   "title": "BACKYARD ACTIVITIES",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>Guests enjoyed ping-pong and created their own melodies on a giant piano mat in the front foyer. We placed subtle touches of branding amongst the games and seating areas where fans could even leave a note for NIGO expressing his influence in their lives.</p>",
     "right": "<p>The afternoon’s cuisine was provided by New York legends <strong>Ghetto Gastro</strong> who brought their famed chicken and matcha waffles, along with an elevated caviar pairing within Nigo’s pool house. Los Angeles pizzeria, LaSorted's, provided handmade pizza and fries.</p>"
